cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "GenomeRSE"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-04"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/NosakhareOsaro/Genome-RSE"
abstract: >-
  A research-software-engineering portfolio project spanning packaged
  Python/R bioinformatics libraries (VCF annotation, a minimal FHIR R4
  validator, an RNA-seq differential expression workflow), an async FHIR
  R4 MolecularSequence REST API, a JBrowse2 genome-browser plugin for
  structural-variant visualization, an MLOps Kubernetes stack (MLflow
  model registry, FastAPI serving, Helm/kind, GitHub Actions CI/CD,
  Terraform IaC), and original, externally-verifiable contributions
  building on them.
authors:
  - family-names: "Osaro"
    given-names: "Nosakhare"
    email: "osaronosakhare@gmail.com"
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - research-software-engineering
  - fhir
  - jbrowse2
  - mlops
  - kubernetes
  - genomics
